1. Scope
This license applies only to PC expansion source code created and published by 阿铭 in this repository. See COPYRIGHT.md for the copyright notice covering project documentation. Game content, third-party material, and unpublished artwork are outside this license.

2. Use, modification, and distribution
Except where applicable law provides otherwise or the author gives prior written permission, you may not use any part of the source code in another project, copy it, modify or adapt it, publish or redistribute it, or use it commercially. The author's written permission must specify the authorized acts and scope. This file does not grant those rights in advance.

A public repository permits the limited actions necessary to view and fork it on GitHub under GitHub's terms. Viewing or forking does not authorize use, modification, or distribution of the code in another project.

3. Attribution after permission
If you are authorized to use all or part of this source code to make or publish a mod, including modified or adapted code, you must clearly credit the following in at least one player-visible location:
- Original author: 阿铭
- Original project: PC expansion
- Source repository: https://github.com/qq2147058809-pixel/ProbablyAssembled

The public mod description, documentation distributed with the mod, or in-game acknowledgements may be used. Source comments, commit history, or private developer records alone do not satisfy this condition. When copying or distributing authorized source code, retain the copyright notice above and this license file. Attribution alone does not replace prior written permission.

4. Rights not granted
This license grants no rights to game code or assets, trademarks, other third-party content, or this project's unpublished artwork. Those rights belong to their respective owners.

To request written permission, contact the author through https://www.nexusmods.com/probablystolen/mods/385 or https://afdian.com/a/aming567 .
